.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
src/**
.gitignore
.yarnrc
vsc-extension-quickstart.md
**/tsconfig.json
**/eslint.config.mjs
**/*.map
**/*.ts
**/.vscode-test.*

# Vendored eval/test corpora, this tool's own local index of itself, dev-only
# virtualenvs, and archived reports -- never meant to ship. Confirmed via
# `vsce ls` before this fix: eval_repos (5.3GB) + tmp_repos (88MB) +
# archive (966MB) alone accounted for 35,169 of 87,630 total packaged files,
# and venv/ (1.2GB, 40,478 files) + .repoguide/ (346MB, 2,429 files) were
# bigger still -- entire third-party repos and a full Python venv were about
# to be bundled into the .vsix.
eval_repos/**
tmp_repos/**
archive/**
venv/**
.repoguide/**
test/**
scripts/**
.github/**

# Root-level investigation/report/planning markdown -- documentation for
# this repo's own development history, not extension content. Only
# README.md and CHANGELOG.md are part of the shipped package.
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
